	(text "PLACE: The package centre is the family anchor driver_center; the exposed pad (49) takes the thermal vias of the footprint into the GND pour." (at 15.24 295.324592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c64067bd-3a59-57d1-85f9-8693189c9b59"))
	(text "PLACE: Place each shunt right at its BR pin (44, 17) with the filter capacitor beside it; the sense loops set the current accuracy." (at 15.24 299.134592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "66c3e8c0-86c2-54b1-a314-417690444bc5"))
	(text "PLACE: Place ${baf77421-44cb-40ec-8e1f-5b430d66d319:REFERENCE} at pin 33 and ${fa49200e-ca5d-4379-af3a-48bc1a3ccb1d:REFERENCE} at pins 34/39 with short returns to GNDA (32); ${9e763c16-dad3-484e-a669-01715055f5de:REFERENCE} between them." (at 15.24 302.944592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "77cdaa9f-dd6a-5746-b9de-688c592eda09"))
	(text "PLACE: Place the 100 nF and 2.2 uF parts at VS pins 21 and 40, the electrolytics behind them on the VM entry." (at 15.24 306.754592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "65757e76-650d-5f25-ba9c-f7c8119aae6d"))
	(text "PLACE: Place ${0791d690-b611-471f-bc36-8c26ff6a5b7e:REFERENCE} at pin 10 and ${107b64cc-4b24-46ae-9fa0-7dea3aeaaa60:REFERENCE} at ${d8e9dab7-a516-4a53-9b28-2ed109176fa7:REFERENCE}'s VDD; ${2fd8aedf-b327-42c6-aa3f-6f0a7df52f87:REFERENCE} near pin 23." (at 15.24 310.564592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0b2ce565-c49e-5c27-acf1-a9b2ba31cbfb"))
	(text "ROUTE: Keep the bridge outputs (MOTOR_2A) and the BRA/BRB shunt loops short and on the component side; logic on the other side of the package." (at 15.24 314.374592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c865b0b9-1a81-5d47-80db-b7231367d685"))
	(text "ROUTE: Kelvin-style short returns from the shunts to GNDP; no shared copper with the bulk capacitors' ripple current." (at 15.24 318.184592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "67bad48f-ad7e-5a9e-99e5-028276700a21"))
	(text "ROUTE: +5V is the board's rail (PWR_5V); 5VOUT stays inside the block." (at 15.24 321.994592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "431461b4-1485-5de9-b9d2-f6d90c9318b6"))
	(text "ROUTE: VM is PWR_HV_BUS: wide copper from the bulk capacitors to the VS pins; the ripple-current return to GNDP, not through the sense shunts." (at 15.24 325.804592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5d366bf3-682d-51f7-9337-c169422fa793"))
